### Post attendance with only IDs (module_id, module_poc_id)
POST http://localhost:9000/attendance/post-attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "module_id": "863662d6-7565-4ba7-aaa5-5ecc9d6cae9e",
  "module_poc_id": "9ccefe74-f80c-4427-804e-827a61d7619a",
  "class_name": "AI&DS-A",
  "date": "2025-04-09",
  "present_count": 43,
  "total_students": 50
}

###

### Post attendance with mod_name and poc_name (no fetch needed)
POST http://localhost:5000/your-route/post-attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "module_id": "MOD123",
  "module_poc_id": "POC456",
  "mod_name": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "poc_name": "Mr. Ram Kumar",
  "class_name": "IV-CSE-A",
  "date": "2025-04-07",
  "present_count": 45,
  "total_students": 50
}




### GET - Fetch All Attendance Records

GET http://localhost:9000/attendance/get-all-attendance

### GET - Fetch Attendance by mod_id, class_name, poc_id
### Get Attendance by Module Name and Class Name
