### ✅ POST - Create a New Attendance Record
POST http://localhost:9000/attendance/post-attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  
  "mod_name": "AI clasics",
  "class_name": "AI-2025",
  "poc_name": "Dr. Vishal",
  "date": "2025-04-11",
  "present_count": 22,
  "total_students": 30
}



